{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"gh pr view 50 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --json number,title,state,isDraft,baseRefName,headRefName,mergeable,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,body,commits,files,statusCheckRollup,url && gh issue view 43 --repo mrkkucharski/vgt --json state,title,url && git diff --stat 4c4cfb2..HEAD && git diff --find-renames 4c4cfb2..HEAD && sed -n '1,220p' docs/stem-separation-plan.md\"","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"Closes #44\\n\\n## Changes\\n\\nSee issue #44 for details.\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-07-20T10:47:19Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"marekkucharski@mini.local\",\"id\":\"\",\"login\":\"\",\"name\":\"Marek Kucharski\"},{\"email\":\"noreply@anthropic.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3\",\"login\":\"claude\",\"name\":\"Claude Sonnet 5\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-07-20T10:47:19Z\",\"messageBody\":\"…espace>/\\n\\nRelocates tempo-click.wav, chords.txt, and sections.txt under the\\nproject's vgt/<namespace>/ folder (the same namespace #43 introduced for\\nstem separation), so the LALAL backend and ReaScript only ever learn the\\nfinal paths once stem outputs exist. The .vgt sidecar itself stays\\nadjacent to the RPP.\\n\\n- sidecar.py: extract artifact_namespace_dir/ensure_artifact_namespace,\\n  shared by analysis.py and separation.py\\n- tempo.py/chords.py/sections.py: artifact path helpers take a namespace\\n  and write under vgt/<namespace>/\\n- status.py: report artifact paths from the recorded namespace\\n- vgt_initialize.lua: import the click WAV from vgt/<namespace>/\\n- .gitignore: replace *.vgt-*.wav/*.vgt-sections.txt fixture ignores with\\n  test/**/vgt/\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"messageHeadline\":\"feat(artifacts): consolidate vgt regenerable artifacts under vgt/<nam…\",\"oid\":\"241beb30967c60dd586ed82f8e227d0a5d8fe912\"}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\".gitignore\",\"additions\":5,\"deletions\":3,\"c